{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02771","headline":"宿晋安亭 · 卢照邻","name":"宿晋安亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有弦歌地，穿凿本多奇。\n游人试一览，临翫果忘疲。\n窗横暮卷叶，檐卧古生枝。\n旧石开红鲜，新河覆绿池。\n孤猿稍断绝，宿鸟复参差。\n泛灩月华晓，裴回星鬓垂。\n今日删书客，凄惶君讵知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}